# Transition Log — {{PROJECT_TITLE}}

> Append-only. One entry per confirmed object-lifecycle transition.
> Newest entries at the top.
>
> Every entry is produced by the `PROPOSE-TRANSITION` /
> `CONFIRM-TRANSITION` protocol defined in `.harness/transitions.yml`
> and `AGENTS.md` §3.1. The AI must never flip an object's `maturity`,
> `status`, or `signed_off` field without recording the transition
> here, including the verbatim evidence quotes it presented and the
> exact confirm string the user replied with.
>
> Rotation: when this log exceeds
> `.harness/quality.yml.memory_management.max_transition_log_lines`, it is
> rotated per `rotate_transition_log_by` (sprint). Closed entries move to an
> immutable slice under
> `docs/00-project-control/archive/transition-log-<sprint-or-date>/`; this
> active log keeps recent entries plus the "Archived slices" pointers below.

